Hi HN,  
I’m Saad and I built OutfitScore.com. We wanted to make professional style, makeup and accessory feedback accessible for everyone.<p>With OutfitScore you can upload a photo of a full outfit, individual clothing piece, accessories, or a makeup look — the AI gives you a numerical score (0-100) in about 5 seconds plus actionable insights. :contentReference[oaicite:1]{index=1}<p>Key features:  
- Free basic scoring with no account required. :contentReference[oaicite:2]{index=2}  
- Upload mirror selfies, flat lays, or individual items. :contentReference[oaicite:3]{index=3}  
- Premium plans unlock detailed breakdowns, body-type work, color theory advice, and analysis history. :contentReference[oaicite:4]{index=4}  
- Also handles accessories (bags, shoes, jewelry) and makeup looks. :contentReference[oaicite:5]{index=5}<p>I’d love your feedback:  
- Does the score feel meaningful and trustworthy to you?  
- What would you like to see next (e.g., outfit comparison, style profiling, API access)?  
- Any biases or improvements you spot in the tool?<p>Thanks for checking it out — happy to discuss how the system works under-the-hood or any of the tech stack if you like.  
Saad
